{
  "key": 28211,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Do any of your Pokémon know...\n",
        "what they call the hidden moves?\r",
        "When a Pokémon faints, it just means\n",
        "it doesn’t have the power to battle.\r",
        "But it can still use hidden moves\n",
        "outside of battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Bill’s PC can store up to 30\n",
        "Pokémon per Box."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know what an Apricorn is?\r",
        "You crack it open to discard the core\n",
        "and put it in this special machine...\f",
        "Then you can catch Pokémon!\r",
        "Before Poké Balls became available,\n",
        "everybody used Apricorns to\f",
        "catch Pokémon.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, hello there, trainer!\r",
        "Would you like to take a quiz?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Excellent! Let’s get started!\r",
        "Question one!\r",
        "Is Sableye the only Pokémon\n",
        "able to have the Stall ability?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": "Aww... come back again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry, but that’s the wrong\n",
        "answer! Please, come and try again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! Time for question two!\r",
        "Is the Lax Incense required in\n",
        "order to breed a Munchlax?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! The semifinal question!\r",
        "Is it true that Reversal has\n",
        "a maximum power of 150?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! The final question!\r",
        "Does Gardevoir have a higher\n",
        "base stat total than Alakazam?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "You completed the quiz!\r",
        "You can now pick a prized Pokémon!\n",
        "Which would you like?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Eh?\n",
        "You don’t want any of them?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00012",
      "en_US": "Treecko"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00013",
      "en_US": "Torchic"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00014",
      "en_US": "Mudkip"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00015",
      "en_US": "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Uhh...\n",
        "Your party is too full..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Woohoo!\n",
        "Look out for more of us Quiz Masters!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00018",
      "en_US": "As you wish!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00019",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a\n",
        "nickname to {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00021",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon do you want?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "I collect Pokémon.\n",
        "Do you have a Gible?\r",
        "Want to trade it for my Beldum?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Yay! I got myself a Beldum!\f",
        "Thanks!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? That’s not Gible.\n",
        "That’s such a letdown..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00025",
      "en_US": "You don’t want to trade? Darn..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, how’s my Beldum doing?\n",
        "Has it evolved yet?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00027",
      "en_US": "Hey, kid! Wanna rock out!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Ha ha!\n",
        "Your answer barely matters!\r",
        "You don’t even have an instrument!\r",
        "But props for talking to me.\n",
        "I’ll give you this to reward you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Shock Wave is a cool Electric-type\n",
        "move that will never miss. Rock on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00030",
      "en_US": "Voltorb: Bzzzzzzt!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0568_T23PC0101_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "After the conclusion of the trade, a\n",
        "mysterious sphere appeared in midair...\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
